  "Candidate-level attribution: a candidate with matches under multiple owners is credited to ONE recruiter (tracker override if present, else most-recent match.owner). This intentionally consolidates funnel activity to preserve monotonicity.",
  "OA internal hires (org_ids 599280 + 1619851), EVERGREEN, POOLING, and 10 EXCLUDE_HASHES are filtered out (matches recruitment_metrics.json).",
  "Ellie owner_ids (225662, 89009) and Marc/me (816616) route to Other via non-membership in RECRUITER_MAP; underlying Manatal ownership on those matches is unchanged."
 ],
 "_note_override": "Per-candidate tracker override applied to ALL funnel stages (not just hires) to guarantee monotonicity per recruiter/month. Tracker-listed candidates get 100% of their funnel activity credited to the tracker recruiter; non-tracker candidates use match.owner (most-recent, candidate-level).",
 "_note_rank5_fix": "2026-09-23: rank-5 (Hire) events now dated by offer_at first, hired_at as fallback (was hired_at first). Manatal's hired_at fires when a candidate is moved to the Started stage and can drift 1-3 days after offer acceptance, misbucketing late-month accepteds into the following month. Impact: Iyah Jun +4, Mark Jun +1; rank-6 (Started) dating unchanged."
}